		(property "Description" "Unidirectional 2-line ESD protection diode, 12V standoff, 14.7V min breakdown, 19V max clamp at 1A, 38pF typ (75pF max), 180W 8/20us, IEC 61000-4-2 30kV contact, AEC-Q101, SOT-23. For slow positive-only lines up to 12V (buttons, 5V pulled-up signals); not for AC signals that swing below GND. Pin 1 cathode 1, pin 2 cathode 2, pin 3 common anode to GND"
			(at 0 0 0)
